{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51436","headline":"行桐柏山 · 姚鹄","name":"行桐柏山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"际海礼冰碧，穿云来玉清。\n千山盘鸟道，十里入猿声。\n草木飘香异，云霞引步轻。\n谁言鳌顶上，此处是蓬瀛。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》一二六《桐拍山部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}